# arduino-cli build output. Deliberately not committed from here: the binaries
# that matter are published as release artifacts with their checksums, and a
# 1.3MB image committed on every build would dominate the repository within a
# few dozen commits.
build/
*.elf
*.map

# Editor / OS cruft
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
combined-checksums.txt

# Detached compile output. The script is kept; its log is not. Both halves have
# their own pair, because CAL and App compile separately and a run of one must
# not overwrite the evidence of the other.
app-compile.log
cal-compile.log

compile-done.flag
cal-done.flag
cal-s3-compile.log
cal-s3-done.flag
app-s3-compile.log
app-s3-done.flag

# The partition table a board script swaps in, parked while it builds. Restored
# and checked by the script; ignored here so an interrupted run never gets
# committed as a change to the 4MB table.
partitions.csv.4mb-backup
App/partitions.csv.4mb-backup
